## Keyboard interactions

- <Kbd>Tab</Kbd> cycles focus inside the dialog (focus trap).
- <Kbd>Esc</Kbd> closes and returns focus to the trigger.
- Initial focus lands on the first tabbable element. Style with `data-state="open"`.
